home.experimental = EXPERIMENTAL
games.experimental_folder = Folder on the card: Roms/%s
sys.doom.note = Put your .wad files (DOOM, DOOM II or the free Freedoom) in Roms/DOOM. prboom.wad is already in /Bios.
sys.quake.note = Put the game folder with pak0.pak in Roms/QUAKE (the shareware version only has pak0.pak).
sys.cavestory.note = Put Cave Story's Doukutsu.exe and data folder (freeware) in Roms/CAVESTORY/<folder>.
sys.ports.note = Ports are adapted PC games that run directly on the device's Linux, opened by a .sh script. Install PortMaster from the store (Apps) and open Ports › Portmaster to pick ports, or put scripts in Roms/PORTS. Ports of the official TrimUI system (a folder with config.json and launch.sh) also work, in Roms/PORTS or in the Ports folder of the card. Each port has its own requirements and none was validated on this device; they may not work.
emu.prboom.note = Free DOOM engine. Works with DOOM, DOOM II, Final DOOM and Freedoom.
emu.tyrquake.note = Quake engine. Needs more CPU; uses the Safe performance profile.
emu.shell.note = Runs the port's script with the firmware shell. Experimental: the port may need extra libraries or PortMaster installed.

